    "detailed_description": "<strong>You are &quot;The Explorer&quot; on an epic mining expedition, digging deep into the underground in search of valuable gem</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287990/extras/9ec60f61204a13488cf8f9d1b94ca888.avif?t=1685107054\" /></span><br><br><strong>You'll encounter mysterious gemstones that are actually gems in human form! Help them fulfill their dreams to shine bright and become the most beautiful gem in the world!!. </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >------Features-----</h2>\u25cf Dig into the mine!<br>\u25cf Gathering of undiscovered gemstones<br>\u25cf Whack a mole<br>\u25cf Upgrade your ability<br>\u25cf Increase your relationship! Date with them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287990/extras/31ab1a26a6039feeee256de3e36a7966.poster.avif?t=1685107054\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287990/extras/31ab1a26a6039feeee256de3e36a7966.webm?t=1685107054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287990/extras/31ab1a26a6039feeee256de3e36a7966.mp4?t=1685107054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >------Gameplay-----</h2>Dig down into the underground world, uncover precious gems, and find desires in her heart.<br><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287990/extras/0fd62c1787ad2711ce2030fadf306518.poster.avif?t=1685107054\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287990/extras/0fd62c1787ad2711ce2030fadf306518.webm?t=1685107054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.a